The '''Traveling Zoo''' is an [[Event]] during which [[Oringo the Traveling Zookeeper]] will visit the [[Hub Island|SkyBlock Hub]] to sell exclusive [[Pets]]. Oringo can be found for 3 in-game Days in the {{Zone|Village}}. The [[Events|Event]] takes place twice a year, in '''Early Summer 1-3''' (in-game time) and in '''Early Winter 1-3'''. A Traveling Zoo event happens, in real-life time, every 2 days and 14 hours, lasting 1 hour each.

